            <div xml:id="d714">

                <pb facs="1020" n="900" xml:id="pg900"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2589: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Technical Board</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stevens</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract—Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-06-29T08:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29, 1922—8
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 30—3:54
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Department’s telegram of June 22, 4 p.m. …</p>
                <p>Considering that the only necessary expense will be that of maintaining the
                    existing organization, I recommend that action be deferred for a short time as
                    developments which may change the railway situation are liable to take
                    place.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stevens</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
